{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Weight ",["f","Weight.png",24]," is a statistic that affects how far an enemy will be knocked back when attacked by ",["l","玩家角色","the player"]," with a ",["l","武器","weapon"],"."]],["p",["Each weapon type has a default weight: ",["l","武器#Dagger","Daggers"]," have a weight of 5, ",["l","武器#Sword","swords"]," 10, and ",["l","武器#Club","clubs"]," 15. Some weapons have a weight modifier, which is added to or subtracted from the default weight. ",["l","锻造#Weapon forging","Forging"]," a weapon with ",["l","紫水晶","Amethyst"],"s will add +10 per amethyst to the weight."]],["p",[["l","紫水晶戒指","Amethyst Ring"],"s and ",["l","锻造#Innate enchantments","innate enchantments"]," affect the weight multiplicatively: the multiplier starts out as 1.0. Each Amethyst Ring adds 0.1 to the multiplier, while a \"-X Weight\" innate enchantment will subtract X/10 from the multiplier. The actual weight value is then the weapon's weight times this multiplier."]],["p",["This means 2 Amethyst rings increase the amount of knockback by 1.2x, while a maximum-level innate enchantment (-5 Weight) will halve the knockback amount."]]]],["Weapons",2,[["p",["The following weapons affect Weight. The effect is permanent while using the weapon."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Effect"]}],[[["f","Crystal_Dagger.png",48]],[["l","水晶匕首","Crystal Dagger"]],[["l","暴击力量","Crit. Power (+50)"],["l","重量","Weight (+5)"]]],[[["f","Wind_Spire.png",48]],[["l","疾风利剑","Wind Spire"]],[["l","暴击力量","Crit. Power (+10)"],["l","重量","Weight (+5)"]]],[[["f","Claymore.png",48]],[["l","双刃大剑","Claymore"]],["Speed (−4)",["l","防御","Defense (+2)"],["l","重量","Weight (+3)"]]],[[["f","Dark_Sword.png",48]],[["l","黑暗剑","Dark Sword"]],["Speed (−5)",["l","重量","Weight (+5)"]]],[[["f","Bone_Sword.png",48]],[["l","骨剑","Bone Sword"]],["Speed (+4)",["l","重量","Weight (+2)"]]],[[["f","Lava_Katana.png",48]],[["l","熔岩武士刀","Lava Katana"]],[["l","防御","Defense (+3)"],["l","暴击力量","Crit. Power (+25)"],["l",